  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Solomon Islands Media Partnership: Pacific Games &amp; Media Association of Solomon Islands 22-23/23-24</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment supported the Solomon Islands&#x2019; media sector to build the capacity and capability of journalists and the public broadcaster (Solomon Islands Broadcasting Corporation), and support the industry&#x2019;s representative association (Media Association of Solomon Islands) to protect media freedoms, promote industry coordination and structures, and strengthen regulations and partnerships within and external to the media industry. The program leveraged Solomon Islands&#x2019; hosting of the Pacific Games in November 2023 as an opportunity to practice the increased coordination, regulation and strengthened partnerships and skills the program sought to promote. The program was implemented by ABC International Development (ABCID), and covered financial years 2022-23 and 2023-24.</narrative>
  </description>
